{
  "id": "E188",
  "title": "Who Does Little Ming Resemble?",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-01-21",
  "synopsis": "Do children more often resemble their father or their mother?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/642/6a19d3cb7ca49372c02514d8a38b4d80e557fccc.mp3?1516136733",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "孩子像谁？\n\n妈妈：小明，你作业做好了吗？\n小明：还没，等我打完这个游戏就做。\n妈妈：又在打游戏！你这孩子怎么跟你爸一样，就知道玩游戏！\n小明：妈妈，昨天你还说我很聪明，像你呢。\n妈妈：昨天你数学作业做得好，当然像我。我上学的时候数学特别好。\n小明：我知道了，好的都像你，不好的都像爸爸。",
    "traditional": "孩子像誰？\n\n媽媽：小明，你作業做好了嗎？\n小明：還沒，等我打完這個遊戲就做。\n媽媽：又在打遊戲！你這孩子怎麼跟你爸一樣，就知道玩遊戲！\n小明：媽媽，昨天你還說我很聰明，像你呢。\n媽媽：昨天你數學作業做得好，當然像我。我上學的時候數學特別好。\n小明：我知道了，好的都像你，不好的都像爸爸。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Who does the kid resemble?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "妈妈：小明，你作业做好了吗？",
      "traditional": "媽媽：小明，你作業做好了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "mā ma xiǎo míng nǐ zuò yè zuò hǎo le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: Little Ming, have you finished your homework?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小明：还没，等我打完这个游戏就做。",
      "traditional": "小明：還沒，等我打完這個遊戲就做。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng hái méi děng wǒ dǎ wán zhè ge yóu xì jiù zuò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Not yet, I’ll do it when I've finished this game."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "妈妈：又在打游戏！你这孩子怎么跟你爸一样，就知道玩游戏！",
      "traditional": "媽媽：又在打遊戲！你這孩子怎麼跟你爸一樣，就知道玩遊戲！",
      "pinyin": "mā ma yòu zài dǎ yóu xì nǐ zhè hái zi zěn me gēn nǐ bà yí yàng jiù zhī dào wán yóu xì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: You are playing games again! You are exactly like your dad, only likes to play games!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小明：妈妈，昨天你还说我很聪明，像你呢。",
      "traditional": "小明：媽媽，昨天你還說我很聰明，像你呢。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng mā ma zuó tiān nǐ hái shuō wǒ hěn cōng ming xiàng nǐ ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Mom, yesterday you said I was smart, just like you."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "妈妈：昨天你数学作业做得好，当然像我。",
      "traditional": "媽媽：昨天你數學作業做得好，當然像我。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma zuó tiān nǐ shù xué zuò yè zuò de hǎo dāng rán xiàng wǒ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "我上学的时候数学特别好。",
      "traditional": "我上學的時候數學特別好。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ shàng xué de shí hou shù xué tè bié hǎo",
      "english": "Mom: You did a good job with your math homework yesterday. Of course you are like me."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "When I was in school I was very good at math."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "小明：我知道了，好的都像你，不好的都像爸爸。",
      "traditional": "小明：我知道了，好的都像你，不好的都像爸爸。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng wǒ zhī dào le hǎo de dōu xiàng nǐ bù hǎo de dōu xiàng bà ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: I know, the good parts are like you, and the bad parts are like my dad."
    }
  ],
